// to build a command or a line of code — never scroll a giant list, never type a whole word. + MACROS: one tap
// → a block (the hacker's "5 keystrokes → a program running in seconds"). vanilla models ship in; the CHERRY
// (rank/seed from YOUR history + codebase) is the next layer. GOFAI — pure frequency + next-token, no model call.

